  "title": "Obsidian Energy Announces TSX Approval for Renewal of Normal Course Issuer Bid",
  "summary": "Calgary, Alberta–(Newsfile Corp. – February 26, 2026) – OBSIDIAN ENERGY LTD. (TSX: OBE) (NYSE American: OBE) (“Obsidian Energy“, the “Company“, “we“, “us” or “our“) is pleased to announce that the Toronto Stock Exchange (the “TSX“) has accepted Obsidian Energy’s notice of intention to renew our normal course issuer bid (the “NCIB“). The NCIB allows Obsidian Energy to purchase up to 6,458,536 common shares (representing 10 percent of the Company’s public float, as defined by the TSX, as of February 17, 2026) over a period of 12 months commencing on March 3, 2026. On February 17, 2026, Obsidian Energy had 67,306,951 common…",
